{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2hwfyxob","slide":10,"name":"object 2","text":"1. Adapter Pattern：UI 只依赖 IProductAdapter，后端可替换。\n2. Worker Grid：24 个计算线程覆盖材料物理、统计、优化模型。\n3. High-density Grid：虚拟滚动、列宽拖拽、sticky、右键菜单与批量操作。\n4. Scientific UX：D3 拓扑、Ashby/GPC/流变/雷达等科研视图整合。\n5. Quality Loop：ErrorBoundary、Toast、报告导出、测试和构建验证闭环。","textPreview":"1. Adapter Pattern：UI 只依赖 IProductAdapter，后端可替换。 | 2. Worker Grid：24 个计算线程覆盖材料物理、统计、优化模型。 | 3. High-density Grid：虚拟滚动、列宽拖拽、sticky、右键菜单与批量...","textChars":235,"textLines":5,"bbox":[65.45,192.02,1149.1,168]}
